{'symbol': 'DXC', 'date': '2022-05-24 03:00:00', 'title': "VW'S CARIAD TAPS LUXOFT FOR FUTURE-ORIENTED IN-CAR SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS", 'text': "AGREEMENT TO TRANSFORM AUTOMOTIVE MOBILITY STUTTGART, GERMANY , MAY 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ - LUXOFT, A DXC TECHNOLOGY (NYSE: DXC) COMPANY, IS WORKING\xa0WITH CARIAD, THE AUTOMOTIVE SOFTWARE COMPANY OF VOLKSWAGEN GROUP, TO PROVIDE VEHICLE SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT, TESTING, AND INTEGRATION SERVICES. LUXOFT IS SUPPORTING CARIAD IN ITS STRATEGIC OBJECTIVE OF CREATING A UNIFORM, SCALABLE SOFTWARE PLATFORM FOR ALL VOLKSWAGEN GROUP BRANDS, INCLUDING VOLKSWAGEN GROUP'S UNIFIED EMBEDDED SOFTWARE PLATFORM VW.OS."}